置和强度，可以生成不同的阴影效果，增加图像的真实感。\n色彩变化：光源颜色的变化会影响图像的整体色调，使图像呈现不同的氛围。\n\nstart_color 参数常连接的节点\nstart_color参数通常用于设置光源的初始颜色。\n这个参数可以连接到以下几种类型的节点：\n\nColor Picker 节点：\n允许用户手动选择光源的颜色。用户可以通过颜色选择器来设置具体的颜色值。\n\nConstant 节点：\n用于设置一个固定的颜色值。\n用户可以通过输入RGB值来设置光源的颜色。\nPYTHON\n\nGradient 节点：\n用于生成渐变色。可以设置一个颜色渐变范围，光源颜色会在这个范围内变化。\n\nImage 节点：\n可以从图像中提取颜色信息，作为光源的颜色。\n比如从一张图片中提取主要颜色来设置光源。\n"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":133,"type":"ImageResizeKJ","pos":{"0":-897.6594848632812,"1":2986.39501953125},"size":{"0":259.5347900390625,"1":238},"flags":{},"order":23,"mode":4,"inputs":[{"name":"image","type":"IMAGE","link":419,"label":"图像"},{"name":"get_image_size","type":"IMAGE","link":null,"label":"参考图像","shape":7},{"name":"width_input","type":"INT","link":null,"widget":{"name":"width_input"},"label":"宽度"},{"name":"height_input","type":"INT","link":null,"widget":{"name":"height_input"},"label":"高度"}],"outputs":[{"name":"IMAGE","type":"IMAGE","links":[398],"slot_index":0,"shape":3,"label":"图像"},{"name":"width","type":"INT","links":[426],"slot_index":1,"shape":3,"label":"宽度"},{"name":"height","type":"INT","links":[427],"slot_index":2,"shape":3,"label":"高度"}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"ImageResizeKJ"},"widgets_values":[1024,1024,"nearest-exact",true,2,0,0,"disabled"]},{"id":135,"type":"PreviewImage","pos":{"0":368.6053161621094,"1":2200.031982421875},"size":{"0":419.8126525878906,"1":446.018798828125},"flags":{},"order":24,"mode":4,"inputs":[{"name":"images","type":"IMAGE","link":421,"label":"图像"}],"outputs":[],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"PreviewImage"},"widgets_values":[]},{"id":136,"type":"MaskToImage","pos":{"0":-276.72796630859375,"1":2960.8134765625},"size":{"0":202.7740020751953,"1":26},"flags":{},"order":46,"mode":4,"inputs":[{"name":"mask","type":"MASK","link":422,"label":"遮罩"}],"outputs":[{"name":"IMAGE","type":"IMAGE","links":[424,430],"slot_index":0,"shape":3,"label":"图像"}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"MaskToImage"},"widgets_values":[]},{"id":137,"type":"Grow